Hi [~accountid:712020:ead1b4e1-6cf2-4677-91f9-a3796e3901ba] 

{panel:bgColor=#deebff}
*Advice:*

Per my previous message, you are free to share additional rides details as long as they do not include additional driver’s personal data (what the customer did not receive yet).

Privacy does not recommend sharing additional data, as there is no clear purpose and legal basis to do this on our side. Sharing this data could be seen as excessive.

*Risks:*

This said, the regulatory risks of sharing additional drivers data with business customers in Azerbaijan are very low. This is due to the limited scope of the requested data (which does not include any sensitive data) and due to low level of enforcement in AZ.
{panel}

{panel:bgColor=#eae6ff}
*As for the technical means of how to export data from business portal:*

Unfortunately, the privacy team cannot assist you here. I suggest to raise a request in #business-product-requests in Slack.
