h3. *Order behaviour:*

* Short ride distance volume
* Short pickup distance volume
* Short ride duration volume
* Short pickup duration volume
* Very long ride distance volume
* Very long pickup distance volume
* Very long ride duration volume
* Very long pickup duration volume
* *Pickup and finish proximity to known stops* (?) 
* Ride not physically completed // Price corrected cases? 

