h1. Thresholds examples:

h3. *1. Fraudulent Payments / Chargebacks (7-day period):*

* *Driver flagged when:*
** ≥ 10% of *ride order payments* are from *fraudulent payment methods*
** ≥ 10% of *total ride order value* (GMV) is attributed to *fraudulent payments*

h3. *2. Repetitive Buyer Activity (7-day period):*

* *Driver flagged when:*
** ≥ 10% of *rides* are from *repetitive transactions* (same rider or identifiers)

h3. *3. Fake Rides / Ride Didn’t Happen (RDNH) (7-day period):*

* *Driver flagged when:*
** ≥ 10% of *rides* are flagged as *fake or not physically completed*

h3. *4. Pre-arranged Rides / Same Buyer-Seller Identity (7-day period):*

* *Driver flagged when:*
** ≥ 10% of *rides* are flagged for being *pre-arranged outside the app*
** ≥ 10% of *rides* involve *same identity* between driver and rider

h3. *5. High Price or Identical Price Transactions (30-day period):*

* *Driver flagged when:*
** ≥ 10 transactions have *very high prices*, defined as:
*** 50,000 TWD with *credit card*
*** 49,000–50,000 TWD with *credit card*
*** 200,000 TWD with *cash*
*** 190,000–200,000 TWD with *cash*
** ≥ 10 transactions have *exactly the same price*
** ≥ 5 *consecutive* payments with *identical price*

